    "status": "approved",
    "summary": "Authorizes moving spec-spine's committed derived directory from .derived/ to .statecraft/derived/, the path Statecraft profile revision 22 treats as generated. Revision 22's policy guard ignores .statecraft/derived/ but not .derived/, so while the shards live at .derived/ a spec-spine pin move cannot regenerate them in its own pull request (spec 061 D-4). The move lands as three pull requests because the guard keeps spec-spine.toml apart from every other non-generated path.\n",
